<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی فاطمہ زہرا (ص)/فرزندوں کو پھر فاطمہ زہرا نے بلایا</div>
<p>farzando'n ko phir fatima zehra ne bulaya<br />
Godi me bithaaya kabhi seene se lagaya<br />
balaae jabee'n bose diye aur ye sunaya<br />
lo pyaro ke hangaam judaayi ka ab aaya</p>

<p>ab tum se juda hoti batool-e uzra hai<br />
ye aaqri zehra ne tumhe pyaar kiya hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hyder se kaha inko na pahonche koi eeza<br />
ye hai mere pyare kabhi inko na ghuraknaa<br />
aur aap se ek arz ye ab karti hai zehra<br />
padhiyo mere laashe pa namaz, aye mere moula</p>

<p>furqat me na in dono ko tadpaiyo saaheb<br />
bachho'n ko meri qabr pa tum laaiyo saaheb<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nazuk hai mizaaj inka ye maalum hai moula<br />
har baat me be saaqta ro deta hai chota<br />
hai qouf ulat jaaye na seene me kaleja<br />
tum usko mere laashe pa bhi rone na dena</p>

<p>sab godh me le martaba quraa'n ka samajh kar<br />
ghur-ke na koi ab ise bin maa ka samajh kar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kahke kiya band dare hujra e at'har<br />
sab qurd-o-kalaa&rsquo;n aan ke rone lage baahar<br />
aawaz suni kalma e tayyab ki baraabar<br />
phir kuch na sada aayi kaha sab ne ye rokar</p>

<p>rehlat huwi bas aaj rasool-e arabi ki<br />
lo uth gayi dunya se nashaani bhi nabi ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>al qissa wo din matam-e zehra me jo guzra<br />
shab aayi khule gesuo'n se dene ko pursa<br />
hyder ne kiya ghusl ka samaan mohayya<br />
masooma ke ek haath me jo zaqm laga tha</p>

<p>wo daste batool aah qameeda nazar aaya<br />
ye dekhte hi mu ko ali ke jigar aaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>nehla ke jo kafnaane lage mayyat-e zehra<br />
zainab ne kaha hatho'n se sar peet ke apna<br />
amma ka mere haath to seedha karo baba<br />
wo roke pukare ye qameeda hi rahega</p>

<p>taboot me phir mayyat-e zahra ko lita kar<br />
sabse kaha lo bibiyo ruqsat karo aakar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kehte the ali fatima ke laashe se ye baat<br />
bas fatima bas ho chuki betou'n se mulaqaat<br />
farzandou ki gardan se juda kijiye ab haat<br />
ruqsat bhi ho ab zindo'n ka aur laashe ka kya saath</p>

<p>chalne me musafir ke ye deri nahi hoti<br />
mayyat se sada aayi ke seri nahi hoti<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>saheb mere bachho'n ko chudhaao na qudaraa<br />
qaatir se meri der karo aur gawaaraa<br />
hoyega meri rooh pa ehsaan tumhara<br />
bachho'n se ziyada mujhe koi nahi pyara</p>

<p>masoomou se dam bhar me bichad jaayegi zehra<br />
phir kaahe ko yu seene se liptayegi zehra<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>